@startuml
left to right direction
actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus study room booking system" {
  usecase "View availability" as ViewAvailability
  usecase "Book room" as BookRoom
  usecase "Cancel booking" as CancelBooking
  usecase "Block or unblock room" as BlockUnblockRoom
  usecase "Review usage" as ReviewUsage
  usecase "Produce confirmation" as ProduceConfirmation

  ' why: R4 makes confirmation a mandatory outcome whenever a booking succeeds.
  BookRoom .> ProduceConfirmation : <<include>>
}

Student --> ViewAvailability
Student --> BookRoom
Student --> CancelBooking
Administrator --> BlockUnblockRoom
Administrator --> ReviewUsage

note bottom of BookRoom
Assumptions:
A1: Touching bookings are allowed.
A2: Blocking keeps existing bookings;
it prevents new bookings only.
end note
@enduml
